SUMMARY:Dream Retirement: Advanced Wealth Strategy Evening in the Energy Corridor
DESCRIPTION:Be Retirement Prepared presents the free\, educational Advanced Wealth Strategy Evening at Hyatt Regency Houston West in the Energy Corridor. \nThe evening will cover advanced tax strategies\, legacy planning\, and withdrawal sequencing designed to protect and preserve your retirement assets. \nThe program will cover the tactics most retirees never consider and the ones that could save significant dollars. \nHighlights\n\n\nAdvanced tax mitigation strategies for your portfolio \n\n\nStrategic Roth conversion timing and tax efficiency \n\n\nNet Unrealized Appreciation (NUA) strategies for concentrated positions \n\n\nCharitable giving and legacy planning structures \n\n\nAsset preservation during market downturns \n\n\nWithdrawal sequencing that minimizes tax drag \n\n\nThere will be no pressure and nothing is sold\, just clear guidance and a chance to get your questions answered. Seating is limited\, so reservations are recommended. \nDoors open at 6:45pm. \nAdmission\nFree with RSVP. RSVP or learn more. \n  \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/dream-retirement-advanced-wealth-strategy-evening-in-the-energy-corridor/
LOCATION:Hyatt Regency Houston West\, 1320 Katy Fwy\, Houston\, 77079\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Classes + Workshops,Continuing Education,Featured,Finance & Investing,Free,Home & Living,Learning & Personal Development,Offers,Pop-Ups,Talks & Panel Discussion
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Dream-Retirement-Advanced-Wealth-Strategy-Evening-in-the-Energy-Corridor.jpg
END:VEVENT
