SUMMARY:The Guess Who in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes The Guess Who to the Sugar Land stage. \nThe Canadian rock band found their greatest success in the late 60s and early 70s\, under the leadership of singer/keyboardist Burton Cummings and guitarist Randy Bachman runiting on stage for the first time in 23 years with hit songs including American Woman\, These Eyes\, No Sugar Tonight/New Mother Nature\, and No Time. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $35. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-guess-who-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Featured,Nightlife,Sports & Athletics
