SUMMARY:Buffalo Trace Barrel Pick Release Party at Social Beer Garden HTX
DESCRIPTION:Social Beer Garden HTX celebrates the release of their exclusive Buffalo Trace single barrel selection\, welcoming bourbon lovers and novices to enjoy a limited-release pour that can’t be found anywhere else. \nThe barrel was selected exclusively for Social Beer Garden HTX\, so every pour is a one-of-a-kind experience. \n\n\nMultiple food trucks will be on site. \n\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover. Learn more. \n\n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
